    <h2 class="sec" id="part-j-colour-in-fashion-combinations-rules-and-when-to-break-them">Part J · colour in fashion — combinations, rules, and when to break them</h2>

    <div class="content-panel">
      <div class="inline-card-title">The wardrobe colour wheel — select a base colour to see harmonious pairings</div>
      <div class="mini-intro">Fashion colour rules differ from art — neutrals (navy, grey, black, white, camel, cream) combine with almost anything. The rules below apply to accent and statement colours.</div>

      <div class="u-mb-md">
        <div class="mini-caption">Choose a base colour:</div>
